# Trading OS — environment template. Copy to `.env` (gitignored), or let `scripts/start.ps1` write what is missing.
# The Python core (python/trading_os) and the Next.js cockpit both read 04_code/.env. Never commit a real value here.
# Reference: python/trading_os/app/config.py (every variable, its type and its default).

# --- Secrets (never printed, never logged: the core masks them) ----------------------------------------------------
# Local tokens — scripts/start.ps1 generates them once. The cockpit presents the first to the core (REST and WebSocket); the
# execution agent presents the second (start.ps1 copies it to MQL5\Files\tradingos_agent.token of each open terminal).
# TRADINGOS_COCKPIT_TOKEN=
# TRADINGOS_AGENT_TOKEN=
# The database, as the core reaches it (the local TimescaleDB container of docker-compose.yml: 127.0.0.1:5433).
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://tradingos:<password>@127.0.0.1:5433/tradingos
# Calendar of economic releases (FRED). Without it the news gate stays closed — it fails closed, it is not a safety gate.
# FRED_API_KEY=

# --- The core --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ceiling of the autonomy ladder: OFF | OBSERVE | PAPER | CONFIRM | ARMED | AUTONOMOUS. The system can never run above it.
# OBSERVE (the default) sends nothing anywhere; raising it is a decision of the trader, never of a script.
# TRADING_MODE=OBSERVE
# false = simulated terminal: no MT5, an in-memory demo account (two open positions, a short history, moving quotes).
# MT5_ENABLED=true
# development | production | test
# TRADING_ENV=development
# LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# Loopback only: the core refuses any other address.
# API_HOST=127.0.0.1
# API_PORT=8000
# The execution agent (MQL5) connects here; its input InpCorePort must match.
# EA_LINK_HOST=127.0.0.1
# EA_LINK_PORT=9765
# Origins allowed to call the core (the cockpit's own).
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000
# Where broker passwords may live: none (default — MT5 keeps its own), windows (OS vault, opt-in), env (development only).
# CREDENTIAL_STORE=none

# --- The cockpit (Next.js) ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Only needed for a core on another loopback port; the default is http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CORE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
